## # rand/types
##
## Types and data structures for the rand package.
## Part of the Alya Language package ecosystem (https://github.com/alya-lang).
##
## Defines PRNG engine selectors, generator state, and weighted items.

## PRNG engine algorithms supported by the rand package.
pub enum RngAlgorithm
    XorShift64 = 1,
    SplitMix64 = 2,
    Pcg32 = 3,
    Lcg = 4
end

## Pseudo-Random Number Generator state and configuration container.
##
## ### Fields
## - `algorithm`: `RngAlgorithm` selector value.
## - `state0`: Primary 64-bit state word.
## - `state1`: Secondary 64-bit state word.
## - `inc`: Increment word for PCG/LCG engines.
pub struct Rng
    algorithm: int,
    state0: int,
    state1: int,
    inc: int
end

## Weighted item structure for weighted choice selections.
##
## ### Fields
## - `item`: Candidate value.
## - `weight`: Relative non-negative weight.
pub struct WeightedItem
    item,
    weight: int
end
